  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>segregation-totals-partials · 1×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 256 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-segregation-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-segregation-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const groupCountsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; groupCounts: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const partialsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; partials: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"10\">// WGSL rejects NaN constants, so build one from a runtime bit pattern.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">fn getNaN() -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">  var bits = 0x7fc00000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">  return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(bits);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const UNITS: u32 = 199u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const K: u32 = 5u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const TERM_COUNT: u32 = 37u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const ATKINSON_B: f32 = 0.5;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">const SELF_WEIGHT: f32 = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">fn countAt(unit: u32, group: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  let value = groupCounts[groupCountsOffset + unit * K + group];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  // Negative, NaN and infinite counts are 0.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  let isFinite = (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  return select(0.0, value, isFinite &amp;&amp; value &gt; 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">fn unitTotal(unit: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  var total = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  for (var group = 0u; group &lt; K; group++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">    total += countAt(unit, group);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  return total;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">fn entropyTerm(share: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  return select(0.0, -share * log(share), share &gt; 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">const LANES: u32 = 256u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">const GROUPS: u32 = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">const COLUMNS: u32 = 6u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">const COLUMN_BATCH: u32 = 8u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">var&lt;private&gt; columnValues: array&lt;f32, 6&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; batchScratch: array&lt;f32, 2048&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">fn reduceColumns(lane: u32, group: u32) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  for (var first = 0u; first &lt; COLUMNS; first += COLUMN_BATCH) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    for (var slot = 0u; slot &lt; COLUMN_BATCH; slot++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">      let column = first + slot;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">      batchScratch[slot * LANES + lane] = select(0.0, columnValues[min(column, COLUMNS - 1u)], column &lt; COLUMNS);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">    for (var stride = LANES / 2u; stride &gt; 0u; stride = stride / 2u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">      if (lane &lt; stride) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">        for (var slot = 0u; slot &lt; COLUMN_BATCH; slot++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">          batchScratch[slot * LANES + lane] += batchScratch[slot * LANES + lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">      workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">    if (lane &lt; COLUMN_BATCH &amp;&amp; first + lane &lt; COLUMNS) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">      partials[partialsOffset + (first + lane) * GROUPS + group] = batchScratch[lane * LANES];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"65\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"66\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  _ = &amp;groupCounts;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  _ = &amp;partials;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  let lane = localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  let group = (index - lane) / LANES;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  if (index &lt; UNITS) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">    for (var column = 0u; column &lt; K; column++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">      columnValues[column] = countAt(index, column);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">    columnValues[K] = unitTotal(index);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">  reduceColumns(lane, group);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>groupCounts<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"groupCounts\">groupCounts</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>partials<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"segregation-totals-partials\">segregation-totals-partials</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUSegregation/total-partials · main · d6cd3f41</figcaption></figure></section>",
